{title: Late Night Dilli}
{artist: DJ Saahil ft. Rhea}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
[Em]Chandni Chowk ki gal[C]iyon mein
[G]Parathe wali raat hai [D]
[Em]Metro chhoot gayi phir [C]se
[G]Koi nahi baat hai [D]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[C]Baby it's a lat[G]e night Dilli
[D]Saari duniya lage [Em]silly
[C]Hold my hand, ch[G]al na yaar
[D]Aaj toh hai bas pyaar [Em]pyaar
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
[Em]India Gate pe hawa tha[C]ndi
[G]Ice cream wali bandi [D]
[Em]Tu hai saath toh lag[C]e aisa
[G]Jaise koi film ki sce[D]ne ho waisa
{end_of_verse}

